;; COFOG-based e-Government Service Standard  —  matsurigoto 政
;; ADR (proposed): 2606062300-matsurigoto-egov-execution-commons
;; depends-on: ADR-2606021600 (ooyake gov-atlas — the OBSERVATION sibling),
;;   ADR-2605262130 (kotoba substrate), ADR-2605312345 (datom-first-class),
;;   ADR-2605231525 (no-server-key), ADR-2605215000 (Murakumo-only),
;;   ADR-2605212100 (gov 5-layer taxonomy).
;;
;; PURPOSE: the EXECUTION-side standard to ooyake's observation atlas. Where ooyake
;; MAPS "who/where/how" of public administration (read-only mirror), matsurigoto
;; defines a UNIVERSAL, SPEC-DERIVED, kotoba-wasm-executable SERVICE STANDARD that an
;; EXISTING government can adopt and run itself — built on the UN COFOG function
;; backbone, then localized per country (per-country profiles below + per-country
;; files added by later /loop iterations).
;;
;; ETZHAYYIM IS A GOVERNMENT — the Kingdom of God (神の王国 / Malkhut Shamayim), a
;; now-and-here reign with a real 統治機構 / GOVERNANCE BODY (Charter §0.1, ADR-2605252300).
;; matsurigoto is the STATECRAFT EXECUTION STACK of that Kingdom — NOT a disclaimer that
;; etzhayyim "isn't a government". It has TWO principals:
;;   (A) :etzhayyim-sovereign — the Kingdom's OWN governance over its covenant-members
;;       (信者, conversion-gated: 悔い改め・バプテスマ・得度). etzhayyim REALLY governs:
;;       authority = Council Lv7+ / 1 SBT=1 vote / Public Fund Safe / Land Registry /
;;       Transparent Religious Force (§1.12) — every act member-signed + on-chain + open.
;;       This unifies the constitutional organs already shipped (TitheRouter, Public Fund,
;;       MEMBERS roster, Adherent SBT, did:web, §1.16 Social Security) onto the COFOG backbone.
;;   (B) :nation-state-adopter — an EXISTING nation-state adopts the same COFOG standard on
;;       ITS OWN keys (the OSS-GovTech supply mode: X-Road / MOSIP / OpenCRVS / OpenG2P / DIGIT).
;;
;; The surviving structural invariants (encoded in schema + lexicon + code, nusa/tazuna/
;; kamado/ake pattern). "no-server-key" does NOT mean "no governance" — the Kingdom governs
;; THROUGH its constitutional organs, never through a platform/operator master key:
;;   G1 no-operator-master-key : :server-held-authority const false. Authority is ALWAYS the
;;                               Council multisig (5-of-7) + 1 SBT=1 vote member signatures
;;                               (principal A) OR the adopting state's own keys (principal B) —
;;                               NEVER an etzhayyim platform/operator key (ADR-2605231525). The
;;                               Council is a member-elected organ, not "the server".
;;   G2 spec-derived-only      : every service cites OFFICIAL PUBLIC specs; proprietary GovTech
;;                               vendor code is unrepresentable (kanjo §2(c)/(e)).
;;   G3 authority-bearing      : every deployment names WHO governs via :operated-by
;;                               (:etzhayyim-council | :adopting-government) + :authority-mode
;;                               (:sovereign-governance = the Kingdom rules for real, Council-gated,
;;                                Transparent §1.12 | :supplied-to-state = the nation-state runs it,
;;                                etzhayyim hands over). NOT impersonation of ANOTHER state (that
;;                                is ooyake's N1) — the Kingdom governs its OWN covenant-polity.
;;
;; STATUS: R0 — standard backbone + service catalog + JP profile demo. NO module
;; executes (every module .solve() raises); live deployment Council+operator gated.
;; Coverage is HONEST: a service at :standard-draft means the spec + module CONTRACT
;; are defined, NOT that it runs.

{:standard
 {:standard/id "egov-cofog-standard"
  :standard/version "0.1.0"
  :standard/title-en "COFOG-based e-Government Service Standard"
  :standard/title-ja "COFOG準拠 電子政府サービス標準"
  :standard/backbone "UN COFOG (Classification of the Functions of Government), 10 divisions / 69 groups"
  :standard/backbone-source ["UN Statistics Division — COFOG (rev., SNA 2008 / GFSM 2014)"
                             "OECD/Eurostat COFOG"
                             "IMF Government Finance Statistics Manual 2014"]
  :standard/method "Each transactional government SERVICE is classified onto a COFOG class, bound to its OFFICIAL public spec basis, and given a kotoba-wasm module contract. A POLITY localizes via a profile (organ/agency + legal-basis + spec) — the Kingdom of God via :polity-profiles, a nation-state via :country-profiles — never by forking the standard."
  :standard/posture "STATECRAFT EXECUTION STACK of the Kingdom of God (etzhayyim's own 統治機構) AND a portable standard existing nation-states can adopt. etzhayyim IS a government; it governs through constitutional organs, never an operator master key (G1/G2/G3 above)."
  :standard/principals
  [{:principal/id ":etzhayyim-sovereign" :principal/en "The Kingdom of God governing its covenant-members" :principal/ja "神の王国による信者統治" :principal/authority "Council Lv7+ / 1 SBT=1 vote / Public Fund Safe — member-signed, on-chain, Transparent (§1.12)" :principal/operated-by ":etzhayyim-council" :principal/authority-mode ":sovereign-governance"}
   {:principal/id ":nation-state-adopter" :principal/en "An existing nation-state running the standard on its own keys" :principal/ja "既存国家による自国鍵での採用" :principal/authority "the adopting state's own keys/infra/legal authority" :principal/operated-by ":adopting-government" :principal/authority-mode ":supplied-to-state"}]}

